    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(At Academy)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After school, most of my friends and I go to academies."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My favorite academy is English."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Everyday I go there to learn new sentences, new words,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and new songs."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Some of my friends are really good at memorizing words"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and phrase."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Some of my friends are really good at conversational English."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I have a Korean for an English teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She has studied English for many years and knows it very well."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When she speaks, she sounds like a native English speaker."
    },
